WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.542
Long ago, a rich man lived in a small village with his son.

2
00:00:19.343 --> 00:00:23.105
The father had to send his son to school far away from home.

3
00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:28.808
"Son," he said, "you will receive a good education at this school."

4
00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:32.377
So the son went away to study.

5
00:00:33.278 --> 00:00:37.520
The father was very sad, but he believed it would be worth it.

6
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:42.823
Someday his son would come back as a successful and well-educated man.

7
00:00:44.824 --> 00:00:47.926
A few years later, the father became very sick.

8
00:00:48.426 --> 00:00:51.187
He called his servant, "Come here.

9
00:00:51.788 --> 00:00:54.049
I want you to write down my will.

10
00:00:54.829 --> 00:00:57.531
I might not be able to see my son again."

11
00:00:57.551 --> 00:00:59.252
"Yes, master."

12
00:00:59.824 --> 00:01:00.905
The servant obeyed.

13
00:01:00.925 --> 00:01:07.731
"To you, my servant, I will give all of my money and my lands.

14
00:01:08.392 --> 00:01:14.037
To my son, I will give one thing only, but he may choose what he will ask for.

15
00:01:14.818 --> 00:01:17.180
Please deliver this will to my son."

16
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:20.783
"Of course, master," said the servant.

17
00:01:21.804 --> 00:01:23.025
Then the father died.

18
00:01:26.816 --> 00:01:28.597
"Ha-ha! All he had is now mine."

19
00:01:28.897 --> 00:01:30.137
The servant laughed.

20
00:01:30.558 --> 00:01:35.520
He was so pleased that he hurried to the son and gave him the letter from his dead

21
00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:37.441
father. "Oh no!

22
00:01:37.841 --> 00:01:41.362
Father!" cried the son.

23
00:01:44.384 --> 00:01:47.525
Days passed, and the son was sad and puzzled.

24
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:54.048
He did not understand why his father had left everything to the servant, but only one request to

25
00:01:54.108 --> 00:01:58.051
him. "Why did my father give everything to his servant?

26
00:01:58.571 --> 00:02:03.235
Why?" The son consulted his wise teacher about this.

27
00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:08.519
"Teacher, I never hurt my father and always tried to obey him.

28
00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:10.501
I thought he loved me.

29
00:02:11.341 --> 00:02:13.763
But I guess he did not love me after all."

30
00:02:13.783 --> 00:02:19.148
"Wait, don't think like that," answered the teacher.

31
00:02:19.168 --> 00:02:22.511
"He really was a very wise father!"

32
00:02:22.531 --> 00:02:26.638
"What? I don't understand," said the son.

33
00:02:28.079 --> 00:02:35.165
The teacher explained: "After your father died, you said that there was no one in the house besides

34
00:02:35.265 --> 00:02:35.845
the servant."

35
00:02:35.865 --> 00:02:39.028
"Yes!" said the son.

36
00:02:39.048 --> 00:02:46.014
"Then, after he died, what if the servant had run away with all of your father's treasures?

37
00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:48.936
Your father must have worried about this.

38
00:02:50.117 --> 00:02:53.580
So he told the servant that everything would belong to him.

39
00:02:54.512 --> 00:02:59.276
That way, his servant was pleased to come and tell you about your father's death."

40
00:02:59.296 --> 00:03:02.699
"But what good does it do me?

41
00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.122
Father's servant owns everything now!"

42
00:03:06.743 --> 00:03:07.683
complained the son.

43
00:03:07.703 --> 00:03:11.687
"Think about it a bit more," suggested the teacher.

44
00:03:11.707 --> 00:03:16.291
"Remember that every servant's possessions belong to his master.

45
00:03:17.131 --> 00:03:20.875
Doesn't your father's will say that you can ask for one thing?"

46
00:03:20.895 --> 00:03:28.418
"Yes!" "So ask your father's servant to be your servant.

47
00:03:29.138 --> 00:03:32.580
Then everything of your father's will belong to you!"

48
00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:35.182
"Ah!" cried the son.

49
00:03:35.202 --> 00:03:38.904
"Now I understand how wise my father was!

50
00:03:39.644 --> 00:03:41.565
I must go back home right away."

51
00:03:42.285 --> 00:03:44.126
He thanked his teacher and left.

52
00:03:45.907 --> 00:03:48.989
When he returned home, he met his father's servant.

53
00:03:49.009 --> 00:03:53.071
"I am here to make my one request," he said.

54
00:03:53.091 --> 00:03:55.993
"Okay," replied the servant.

55
00:03:56.013 --> 00:04:00.996
"According to your father's will, you can ask for only one thing."

56
00:04:01.016 --> 00:04:06.100
"My only request is that you serve me for the rest of your life."

57
00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.842
"What? No way!"

58
00:04:09.302 --> 00:04:10.103
said the servant.

59
00:04:10.823 --> 00:04:16.667
But deep down inside his heart, the servant knew that a servant's possessions belong to his master.

60
00:04:17.508 --> 00:04:19.589
He could not refuse the son's request.

61
00:04:19.609 --> 00:04:23.232
"Do not feel so sad," said the son.

62
00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.682
"I will share my wealth with you."

63
00:04:25.702 --> 00:04:27.524
"Oh, thank you!

64
00:04:27.904 --> 00:04:29.185
I will serve you gladly!"

65
00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:30.706
replied the servant.

66
00:04:32.468 --> 00:04:35.871
The son was proud to be the son of such a wise man.

67
00:04:36.672 --> 00:04:39.374
So he tried to become just like his father.

68
00:04:40.355 --> 00:04:42.377
He treated his servant very well.

69
00:04:43.318 --> 00:04:49.504
Eventually, the son also became a wise and successful businessman, just like his father.
